steps:
5. Branch geo2b from geo1b, as in GEO1B.md 4-1/4-2: check out the GEO2.md code and apply geo2b.patch. Then extend build_geo.py to D0:
- uid D0_<rid>;
- label TS = the Coley profile TS;
- G2c folder $G2C/d0/g2_final/<rid> (rel1/rel2 byte-copied);
- coordinates = mean of final_f{fold}_s{0,1,2};
- same sanity checks and G2c fallback, with fallback <= 2% checked separately for D1 and D0;
- cross-check against E_rxn.csv for D1 and E_rxn_d0.csv for D0 (1e-6 A).
Run Z, a short job.

6. Combined input root (F/H-1) under $GEO2B.
- Merged files:
  - labels json = labels_d1_g2 rows + the D0 non-overlap rows of labels_all, with job_id D0G2_<rid:04d>;
  - meta csv with A_idx from both input_meta files;
  - prof symlink directory (D1 -> d1_jobs/T*, D0 -> full_dataset_profiles/<rid>);
  - HF template symlink root (D1 -> d1_hf/inputs/T*, D0 -> new templates).
- D0 Phase X: prep.hf_text on the SMD eda.inp and frag*.inp. Checks X-1..X-3: SMD ok, coordinates equal the Coley TS/reference files, (1) tags equal A_idx.
- D0 S-1 check: rerun the original B3LYP inputs at %pal 1 for 3 D0 reactions. They must reproduce labels_all.json to <= 0.01 kcal/mol.
- Patch feat_geo.py:
  - geo_base over D1 + D0;
  - an order_g branch for D0 via labjobs/D0G2_*;
  - g2_inputs_check against a new sha record;
  - h_inputs n_atoms from the merged labels.
- Patch the prep/build target lists. Record D0 Q keys for P.

7. Phase T checks: t2_g, t2_f and t3 on D1, plus a 20-reaction D0 smoke set (stratified by n_atoms quartile, including charged reactions). Then run G, F and H.
- G: xTB Freq, about 6 slices x 16 workers.
- F: f_slice, f_atoms, f_rest.
- H, in order:
  - pilot of 50 reactions: 25 D1 + 25 D0, stratified;
  - the rest as h_batch over 10 x 64-core jobs;
  - rel-energy gate (1e-6 Eh) only on D1 rows where G2c picked the orig run;
  - failure gates as rates: QA_MAX_FAIL = 0.5% of the combined count; Freq / Q-a / T-a / H failures <= 1% per dataset.
- H cap raised to 4,000 core-h (projection about 3,300-3,400); record it in DECISIONS.

10. C_tests_geo.json:
- L-1..L-9 and L-11' on rung geo;
- regression 1-3: stage 1/2 unit lists unchanged; L-6/L-10; g2-S-XGB fold 0 reproduction <= 1e-6;
- D0 checks: no D0 test reaction in any training pair of its unit; D0 pairs never in inner_val;
- smoke: 2 epochs per cell for AW/GNN/TF, plus XGB smoke; gate M-1' on test pairs and on 200 random D0 training pairs.
Project GPU-h from the smoke runs and record the cap, 160 GPU-h.
